# Rust (workspace root target and stray build dirs inside crates)
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Editors and system
*.swp
.DS_Store
.tooling/
.pi-subagents/

# Machine-local cargo env (wreq/btls-sys LIBCLANG_PATH etc. — absolute
